{"parentUuid":"950ca408-d6bd-4c62-a5c7-5f8e86145402","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_014FS1wAELPmUFrSv1opmjoH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Without reading your actual file, I can identify several common reasons this config format silently fails in Claude Code:\n\n**Most likely cause: `npx` not in PATH**\n\nClaude Code launches MCP servers in a restricted environment that may not inherit your shell's full `PATH`. If `npx` isn't at a standard location, the server never starts. Fix by using the absolute path:\n\n```json\n\"command\": \"/usr/local/bin/npx\"\n// or on Apple Silicon:\n\"command\": \"/opt/homebrew/bin/npx\"\n```\n\nRun `which npx` in your terminal to find yours.\n\n**Second most likely: missing `-y` flag**\n\n`npx @package@latest` without `-y` will prompt \"Need to install the following packages — OK to proceed?\" and hang waiting for input. Claude Code can't answer that prompt, so the server never responds:\n\n```json\n\"args\": [\"-y\", \"@zilliz/claude-context-mcp@latest\"]\n```\n\n**Other causes to rule out:**\n\n- **JSON syntax error** in `~/.claude/settings.json` — Claude Code silently ignores a malformed file. Validate it with `python3 -m json.tool ~/.claude/settings.json`\n- **Wrong file** — global MCP config goes in `~/.claude/settings.json` (not `.claude/settings.json` in the project, and not `~/.claude.json`)\n- **Server crashes on connect** — if the Milvus credentials are wrong, the process exits immediately and Claude Code treats it as absent\n\nThe `-y` flag + absolute `npx` path fixes the vast majority of `npx`-based MCP failures. Try both together first."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":634,"cache_read_input_tokens":50677,"output_tokens":1499,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":634,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":3,"output_tokens":1499,"cache_read_input_tokens":50677,"cache_creation_input_tokens":634,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":634},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CbpuV9F6h2LkDn4ysQy1E","type":"assistant","uuid":"982a5dea-72e9-4b16-89a8-34d2807d61dc","timestamp":"2026-06-08T01:14:15.830Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Volumes/Work Drive/source/repos/kanban","sessionId":"db10a494-6028-40e2-96b7-a1dc111e74ec","version":"2.1.168","gitBranch":"002-us6-validation-unification"}
